## fsharp

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

### option'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl option'_types () : () =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => global \"import gleam/option\"\n    }\nnominal option'_gleam t =\n    `(\n        option'_types ()\n        $'' : $'option.Option(`t)'\n    )\ntype option'_switch t =\n    {\n        Gleam : option'_gleam t\n        Lua : t\n        Fsharp : $\"`t option\"\n        Python : t\n        Rust : $'Option<`t>'\n        TypeScript : t\n    }\nnominal option' t = $'backend_switch `(option'_switch t)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl option'_types () : () =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => global "import gleam/option"
      }
  nominal option'_gleam t =
      `(
          option'_types ()
          $'' : $'option.Option(`t)'
      )
  type option'_switch t =
      {
          Gleam : option'_gleam t
          Lua : t
          Fsharp : $"`t option"
          Python : t
          Rust : $'Option<`t>'
          TypeScript : t
      }
  nominal option' t = $'backend_switch `(option'_switch t)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### none'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl none' forall t. () : option' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'option.None' : option' t\n        Lua = fun () => $'nil' : option' t\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'None' : option' t\n        Python = fun () => $'None' : option' t\n        Rust = fun () => $'None' : option' t\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'undefined' : option' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl none' forall t. () : option' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => $'option.None' : option' t
          Lua = fun () => $'nil' : option' t
          Fsharp = fun () => $'None' : option' t
          Python = fun () => $'None' : option' t
          Rust = fun () => $'None' : option' t
          TypeScript = fun () => $'undefined' : option' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

