<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl some' forall t. (x : t) : option' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'!x |> option.Some' : option' t\n        Lua = fun () => $'!x ' : option' t\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'Some !x ' : option' t\n        Python = fun () => $'!x \\# some\\' ' : option' t\n        Rust = fun () => $'Some(!x.clone())' : option' t\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'!x ' : option' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl some' forall t. (x : t) : option' t =
