<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> gleam\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\ninl x = Some 3i32\ninl y : option i32 = None\ninl x' = x |> box |> unbox\ninl y' = y |> box |> map id |> unbox\n(x', y') |> _assert_eq' (x, y)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> gleam
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript

  inl x = Some 3i32
  inl y : option i32 = None
  inl x' = x |> box |> unbox
  inl y' = y |> box |> map id |> unbox
  (x', y') |> _assert_eq' (x, y)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

