<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n////> gleam // Expected type: #(String) Found type: #(Nil)\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n////> rust // attempted to zero-initialize type `alloc::sync::Arc<dyn core::any::Any>`, which is invalid\n///> typescript\n///> cuda\n\nnull ()\n|> of_obj\n|> unbox\n|> _assert_eq (None : option string)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ////> gleam // Expected type: #(String) Found type: #(Nil)
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda
  ////> rust // attempted to zero-initialize type `alloc::sync::Arc<dyn core::any::Any>`, which is invalid
  ///> typescript
  ///> cuda

  null ()
  |> of_obj
  |> unbox
  |> _assert_eq (None : option string)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

